{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toss. Aim. Score. Urban Style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to<strong>\u00a0Disc Golf City</strong>, an arcade-inspired disc golf game where the concrete jungle becomes your playground. Whether you're curving a disc through alleyways or banking a trick shot off a rooftop, every course is packed with stylish scenery and sneaky targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate city parks, plazas, and rooftops in this low-poly 3D world, all while unlocking bonus achievements for hitting signs, bins, and hidden targets in your path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/ec402b429a229b5736dd287722e0740e.poster.avif?t=1764629279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/ec402b429a229b5736dd287722e0740e.webm?t=1764629279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/ec402b429a229b5736dd287722e0740e.mp4?t=1764629279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4f <strong>Arcade-style disc golf</strong> set in a familiar city environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Hit the basket</strong>... or go for <strong>bonus trick shot targets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized low-poly 3D visuals</strong> with a colorful city vibe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Multiple levels</strong> inspired by real city layouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 <strong>Family-friendly gameplay</strong> for all ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple to play, challenging to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragra